GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "0F09BD789C61C5E6"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{BC0DE7D5488A63CF}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "<b>Date:</b> 2025-05-04"\
     "<b>Location:</b> Kunar Province, Afghanistan"\
     ""\
     "U.S. Army forces are currently engaged against a newly formed radical offshoot of a known terrorist organization operating within the region. This group has demonstrated increased coordination and tactical capability compared to previous insurgent elements."\
     ""\
     "<b>Recent intelligence confirms the enemy has begun employing:</b>"\
     ""\
     "- Small drones for surveillance and targeting."\
     ""\
     "- Coordinated light infantry assaults, ussually supported by stolen or makeshift APC and gun trucks."\
     ""\
     "As part of a wider battalion-level operation to reestablish presence and deny insurgent freedom of movement in the Kunar region, an understrength U.S. Army Infantry Platoon has reoccupied OP Dallas."\
     ""\
     "Reports indicate enemy forces are massing near the town of Ali Abad. Assessment suggests preparation for a deliberate attack against friendly positions at OP Dallas within the coming hours."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3404B53BD663877F}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "<b>Date:</b> 2025-05-04"\
     "<b>Location:</b> Kunar Province, Afghanistan"\
     ""\
     "American forces have returned to Kunar and intend to disrupt our activities in the region. The enemy hides behind sandbags and walls and expects to be safe from our retribution. They are wrong."\
     ""\
     "Brothers from nearby villages have gathered in the vicinity of Ali Abad and are prepared for action. We will show the imperialist scup who really owns these mountains."\
     ""\
     "Our informants tell us they are weak and unprepared. The base that they call OP Dallas has been abandoned previously and a small sized element has just recently returned to reinforce it. That will not be enough."\
     ""\
     "<i>We will teach them to fear us anew.</i>"\
     ""\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EA584CBA37CF4AAB}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "SITUATION REPORT"
     m_sContent "An understrength U.S. Army Infantry Platoon conducts a defence of a previously abandoned OP in Kunar, Afganistan. They must hastily adapt to fighting a new generation of insurgents that are already proficient in the <i>latest</i> methods of terror."\
     ""\
     "<b>RATIO: 1:2</b>"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DC4BE31DE91934D5}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "FRIENDLY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Higher headquarters continues offensive operations elsewhere in the province. Immediate reinforcement is limited due to ongoing commitments across the AO."\
     ""\
     "Adjacent friendly units are operating outside immediate supporting distance. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0747C05D13AA0759}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "FRIENDLY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Our brothers in the wider Kunar area are conducting a synchronized assault and are unable to assist at this moment. This should tie up their reinforcements and prevent immediate rescue."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C5E96A68CD397D69}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "ENEMY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Enemy strength is estimated to be at around a platoon-sized element."\
     ""\
     "Earlier reports indicate that they possess a stolen APC and limited mortar support."\
     ""\
     "<b>Enemy is know to use small reconnaissance and IED drones.</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5D6040E1080C6C70}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "ENEMY FORCES"
     m_sContent "American forces have returned to OP Dallas with an understrength infantry platoon. "\
     ""\
     "Our informants report seeing the enemy carrying standart gear except from a few individuals armed with heavy weaponry."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{CF3F6B170E115740}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
     m_sContent "<b>Defend OP Dallas and eliminate attacking enemy forces.</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{CDB61581952917C5}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
     m_sContent "Take control of OP Dallas and kill the invaders to the last man."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AFBA286264760655}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "EXECUTION"
     m_sContent "As per CO's intent."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{058DB42197D1873B}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "EXECUTION"
     m_sContent "As per CO's intent."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3E3A5936554760A3}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "ADMIN & LOGISTICS"
     m_sContent "Soldiers are equipped with their standart combat load."\
     ""\
     "During the previous pullback from the region some construction supplies were left behind at OP Dallas:"\
     ""\
     "- 200 Plastic sandbags"\
     ""\
     "A small cache of weapons, captured during a recent patrol:"\
     ""\
     "- 2x AK-47 rifles"\
     "- <b>2x Remington 870 shotguns </b>"\
     "- 1x VZ-58V rifle"\
     "- 3x M-112 Demolition blocks"\
     "- 1x M-34 Blasting machine"\
     "- Ammunition for the afformentioned weapons."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D91A1759558A7B07}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "ADMIN & LOGISTICS"
     m_sContent "We currently possess:"\
     ""\
     "- 1x BRDM-2 APC"\
     "- 1x UAZ-469 armed with a PKM "\
     "- 2x Recon FPV drones with 2 extra batteries"\
     "- 2x IED FPV drones"\
     "- 1x 82mm Mortar"\
     "- 10x 82mm HE shells and 25x 82mm SMK shells"\
     "- Various transport vehicles"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{41CA42F8F6C30143}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "EW CAPABILITIES"
     m_sContent "Battalion has provided us with a singular static drone jammer located inside the Comand Post."\
     ""\
     "Combat reports show that while effective at interfering with drone signals, <b>the jammers are unable to completely nullify the drone threat.</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7EA224E7E275DC25}" {
     m_iOrder 14
     m_sTitle "INFORMATION ON DRONES"
     m_sContent "<b>Drones are located in a beige van next to the drone operators.</b>"\
     ""\
     "Our drones have limited range. Previous attemts to scout OP Dallas indicate they have some sort of jamming around their base. <b>We might need to get closer to ensure an acceptable signal strength...</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
